{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G3-04","example":{"issue":{"title":"鄉區斜交四岔，主次道路是否容易分辨？","intro":"鄉區路口的主次道路關係不易由道路外觀直接判斷。","images":[{"key":"results:g3-04-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"crop":[0,0,2920.072,2424]},{"key":"results:g3-04-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-04-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-04-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-04-photo-4","label":"現況照片 4","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"priority","title":"主次道路辨識不足","text":"路口缺少必要的警示與管制提示，駕駛不易判斷停讓。"},{"id":"speed","title":"速度限制不明確","text":"兩條道路的速限標字與標誌提示不足。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[83,84],"strategy":{"title":"用槽化與停讓提示整理斜交路口","intro":"從次要道路入口、路面邊界到橋梁限制，依序提示駕駛通行條件。","images":[{"key":"results:g3-04-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"channelization","title":"讓次要道路入口更明確","text":"以類滴狀島槽化分隔來車，引導車輛接近斜交路口。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"priority","title":"明確停等與車行邊界","text":"搭配停止線、停讓提示及路面邊線，界定駕駛的停等與行駛位置。","moduleId":"M2-01"},{"id":"walking","title":"依需求安排穿越設施","text":"有行人穿越需求時配置行穿線，並與兩端步行空間一起檢視。","moduleId":"M3-01"},{"id":"bridge","title":"提前告知橋梁限重","text":"在路口上游提示前方橋梁限制，讓受限車輛能提早選擇繞道或迴轉。","moduleId":"M4-02"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-3-04-unsignalized-rural-skewed-cross.typ","sha256":"045f9fe5624845ad15ed66e980554773ded33346728ac8ee28540c172d9dc811","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g3-04-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-04/G3-04_現況圖_01.png","width":3040,"height":2424,"label":"G3-04 現況圖","scenario":"G3-04","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":83,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image106.png","sha256":"f8238559dc4b079d4bff51ede3797e6804ca6eb17a9ef2ce91fcf77f797a4399"},"results:g3-04-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-04/G3-04_現況照片_01.png","width":2502,"height":1387,"label":"G3-04 現況照片","scenario":"G3-04","role":"photo","rotati